# Defense: prevent stray lockfiles from mixed package-manager installs.
# Frontend uses npm (root), backend uses pnpm (finmark-backend/).
# If you see a pnpm-lock.yaml at repo root, someone ran `pnpm install` at the
# frontend by mistake — delete it. If you see a package-lock.json under
# finmark-backend/, someone ran `npm install` in a pnpm project — delete it.
**/package-lock.json
/pnpm-lock.yaml
